WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.165 --> 00:00:13.264
[Subtitles by danielsangeo]

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:15.930
Nnngrrrragh!

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:17.889
[announcement klaxons]

00:00:17.889 --> 00:00:18.659
PA: Danger.

00:00:18.659 --> 00:00:19.465
"Danger"!

00:00:19.465 --> 00:00:25.526
PA: High energy exchange detected
in radioactive materials handling bay.

00:00:25.526 --> 00:00:28.013
"Radioactive materials".

00:00:28.013 --> 00:00:32.018
Oh, Jesus, that just gave me
a horrible thought.

00:00:32.018 --> 00:00:37.288
No... no! We can't be
THAT stupid! Please! No!

00:00:37.288 --> 00:00:41.426
Oh, this isn't so bad. This column
is clearly waiting for me to pass

00:00:41.426 --> 00:00:45.492
THEN it will collapse so I can
die of thirst or starvation.

00:00:45.492 --> 00:00:48.660
Maybe I already am and
don't even know it yet.

00:00:50.723 --> 00:00:54.705
NO, YOU DON'T HAVE TO FEED
ME BEES; IT'S NOT THAT BAD!

00:00:54.705 --> 00:00:59.103
Okay, can your alien intellect
figure out how doors work?

00:00:59.103 --> 00:01:00.892
[metallic thumping]

00:01:00.892 --> 00:01:02.870
Oh, they're thinking about it.

00:01:03.728 --> 00:01:06.876
Maybe it's too hard for them...
since it's motion-sensored?

00:01:07.970 --> 00:01:10.219
Yeah, they couldn't figure it out.

00:01:11.402 --> 00:01:14.065
Well, good job trying
to ambush me. Almost.

00:01:14.592 --> 00:01:17.984
Hey, I'm getting low on shells
so you know what that means.

00:01:19.829 --> 00:01:22.342
[agrunt moans]

00:01:22.342 --> 00:01:24.608
Hey, I don't like this
any more than you do.

00:01:24.608 --> 00:01:28.013
Rockets for tanks and attack
choppers are no-brainers.

00:01:28.013 --> 00:01:31.730
Frankly, it's a bit much for you,
but what am I supposed to do?

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:34.401
I'm low on ammo and you're
running across the room.

00:01:34.401 --> 00:01:36.805
Huh, guess I won't die of thirst.

00:01:36.805 --> 00:01:40.632
But yeah, what am I supposed to do, go
hand-to-hand with the bodybuilder aliens?

00:01:40.632 --> 00:01:42.820
Yeah, that'd be smart, wouldn't it?

00:01:42.820 --> 00:01:45.720
I suppose that'd be the
"honorable" thing to do,

00:01:45.720 --> 00:01:48.264
but "honor" doesn't really apply to me.

00:01:48.264 --> 00:01:49.150
I mean, look at the--

00:01:49.150 --> 00:01:50.708
[teleportation sound]
OH MY GOD!

00:01:51.319 --> 00:01:54.492
Well, thanks for testing the
tensile strength of the catwalk,

00:01:54.492 --> 00:01:56.648
but your services are no longer required.

00:01:58.162 --> 00:02:01.052
Yeah, just ignore gunfire.
That works for me.

00:02:02.211 --> 00:02:02.640
Wow!

00:02:03.806 --> 00:02:07.699
All right, so I guess the aliens have lowered
their standards for shock troopers.

00:02:09.028 --> 00:02:11.292
I mean, that alien was obviously high.

00:02:11.292 --> 00:02:14.425
He falls off a ledge.
He doesn't care, he's high.

00:02:14.425 --> 00:02:17.222
I shoot him in the head.
He doesn't care, he's high.

00:02:18.297 --> 00:02:20.374
He's a galactic stoner.

00:02:20.374 --> 00:02:24.074
But yeah, while the resource
allocation DOES concern me,

00:02:24.074 --> 00:02:27.901
I'm not going to lose sleep over bringing
a rocket launcher to a bee fight.

00:02:28.745 --> 00:02:29.513
Umm...

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:32.384
[straining]
Okay, maybe this does something.

00:02:33.251 --> 00:02:38.814
Yeah... the thing is, fighting honorably
and winning are incompatible goals.

00:02:38.814 --> 00:02:42.298
In World War II, the Japanese
TRIED to do it honorably

00:02:42.298 --> 00:02:44.553
but even they knew it
wasn't going to work.

00:02:44.553 --> 00:02:45.935
Like, when they hit Pearl Harbor.

00:02:46.716 --> 00:02:48.300
The idea...

00:02:49.491 --> 00:02:50.626
...come on...

00:02:51.805 --> 00:02:55.827
The idea was attacking the USA
unaware would be dishonorable,

00:02:55.827 --> 00:02:59.620
so they tried warning us half an
hour before it happened,

00:02:59.620 --> 00:03:04.287
but their military delayed that message
until 20 minutes AFTER it happened.

00:03:05.896 --> 00:03:06.455
Fuck!

00:03:08.358 --> 00:03:11.363
So, I guess they kept their
honor on a technicality?

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:15.938
Like the ball was on the goal line and
there were three seconds left on the clock,

00:03:15.938 --> 00:03:19.038
therefore the Pearl Harbor attack
was honorable or something?

00:03:20.808 --> 00:03:24.465
Yeah, what the hell am I talking
about? This is my last pistol magazine.

00:03:24.465 --> 00:03:26.368
Of course I used the right weapon!

00:03:26.368 --> 00:03:29.100
More guns, less madness.

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:30.525
Okay, what's the story on this guy?

00:03:30.525 --> 00:03:32.081
Did he blow his brains out?

00:03:32.081 --> 00:03:33.938
I hope he left some bullets behind.

00:03:33.938 --> 00:03:35.991
But, it's hard to say; knowing our staff,

00:03:35.991 --> 00:03:38.579
he probably missed a few times
trying to aim for his head.

00:03:39.278 --> 00:03:41.462
No, I don't see anything.

00:03:41.462 --> 00:03:45.166
Okay, another pump. I was trying
not to think about this.

00:03:45.166 --> 00:03:49.744
I don't exactly know what this switch
does, but I need to pull it right now,

00:03:49.744 --> 00:03:53.681
because if I'm wrong, I made some parts
move around and some lights flash,

00:03:53.681 --> 00:03:54.960
doesn't matter.

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:58.709
But, if I'm right about this...
Oh my God!

00:03:58.709 --> 00:04:02.391
Being right about everything is a curse!

00:04:02.391 --> 00:04:03.981
Let's look at the evidence:

00:04:03.981 --> 00:04:07.546
we have a staff member getting
snippy with me about a reactor;

00:04:07.546 --> 00:04:11.151
we have that intercom talking
about biological contaminants;

00:04:11.151 --> 00:04:13.586
we have those red pump warning lights;

00:04:13.586 --> 00:04:16.571
and we have the building
literally falling apart.

00:04:16.571 --> 00:04:22.187
I think we have a nuclear reactor
down here, an alien teleported inside it,

00:04:22.187 --> 00:04:24.179
now it's broken,

00:04:24.179 --> 00:04:27.895
and is going to meltdown unless
I flood it with coolant.

00:04:28.669 --> 00:04:32.241
I mean, somebody tell me I'm wrong,
that a team of top researchers

00:04:32.241 --> 00:04:35.065
are not so tragically obtuse

00:04:35.065 --> 00:04:39.335
that we pass off a fucking China syndrome
as just "one of those things"!

00:04:40.376 --> 00:04:44.522
The scientist trying to give me
orders was slightly annoyed.

00:04:44.522 --> 00:04:47.175
He wasn't somber or panicked at all.

00:04:47.175 --> 00:04:51.115
Yeah, a meltdown IS really
annoying. I get it!

00:04:51.115 --> 00:04:55.422
I think I'm the only person here who
understands how serious this is.

00:04:56.077 --> 00:04:59.423
I hope I'm wrong, but this is
all too plausible.

00:04:59.423 --> 00:05:03.297
Even though we have a dam, we
use as much power as a city.

00:05:03.297 --> 00:05:06.525
I can believe we have a nuclear
reactor here also.

00:05:06.525 --> 00:05:09.531
Plus, these are my colleagues who
thought sealing off the entrance

00:05:09.531 --> 00:05:12.197
would contain random teleportations.

00:05:12.197 --> 00:05:14.903
They drew straws to decide
who would let me in.

00:05:14.903 --> 00:05:19.752
Now that I am in, I'm sure the prevailing
theory being discussed behind my back

00:05:19.752 --> 00:05:21.944
is that all these aliens just showed up

00:05:21.944 --> 00:05:25.243
during the two minutes they left
the door open and I walked in.

00:05:25.243 --> 00:05:27.761
This is my fault. Of course.

00:05:27.761 --> 00:05:31.645
I know what's happening here.
I've seen this a hundred times.

00:05:31.645 --> 00:05:33.976
This reeks of groupthink.

00:05:33.976 --> 00:05:37.979
You have one normally brilliant
person make a stupid decision

00:05:37.979 --> 00:05:41.869
and everyone else just falls in
line, doesn't question anything.

00:05:41.869 --> 00:05:46.117
These people aren't scientists;
they're cultists with advanced degrees.

00:05:46.117 --> 00:05:50.945
I guess I'll go talk to the reactor guy,
find out just how long we have to live.

00:05:50.945 --> 00:05:53.737
SHOW ME YOUR HANDS OR I'LL
BLOW YOUR FUCKING HEAD OFF!

00:05:54.385 --> 00:05:56.509
Yeah, try me, psycho-breath!

00:05:56.509 --> 00:05:58.550
GUARD: Our luck has to
change sooner or later.

00:05:58.550 --> 00:06:00.185
What's THAT supposed to mean?!

00:06:00.726 --> 00:06:02.080
NO, DON'T ANSWER THAT!

00:06:02.080 --> 00:06:04.652
I'M NOT LETTING YOU GET INSIDE MY MIND!

00:06:04.652 --> 00:06:07.831
Fucking psycho Kurtz
serial-killing security guard...

00:06:08.959 --> 00:06:10.109
Hey, we need to talk!

00:06:10.109 --> 00:06:13.240
SCIENTIST: Don't linger Mr. Freeman!
You've turned on the pumps!

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:16.033
SCIENTIST: Now take the access
pipe, flood the core,

00:06:16.033 --> 00:06:18.576
SCIENTIST: and get on up to the
labs without delay!

00:06:18.576 --> 00:06:21.477
Oh, so NOW you're talking like
there's some urgency.

00:06:21.477 --> 00:06:24.500
The ramifications are
starting to sink in, huh?

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:27.611
Well, I saved your ass.
And everyone else's.

00:06:27.611 --> 00:06:30.165
If you clowns had just said the
word "meltdown",

00:06:30.165 --> 00:06:31.935
we could've saved a lot of time.

00:06:31.935 --> 00:06:34.596
Your communication skills are horrible.

00:06:34.596 --> 00:06:38.563
I swear, I'm the only person in this
building who's not an idiot savant.

00:06:38.563 --> 00:06:41.719
PA: Lambda Complex reports
dimensional contamination.

00:06:41.719 --> 00:06:43.100
"Dimensional"...

00:06:43.523 --> 00:06:45.205
GUARD: What the hell is this?

00:06:45.205 --> 00:06:46.678
WHAT DO YOU THINK IT IS, POP TART?!

00:06:46.678 --> 00:06:49.169
IT'S ME POINTING A 12-GAUGE AT YOUR FACE!

00:06:49.169 --> 00:06:51.940
You may think you're hard because
you plugged a scared old man,

00:06:51.940 --> 00:06:54.509
but try that number on me and
watch what happens!

00:06:54.509 --> 00:06:57.405
I didn't come all this way just
to get shot in the back of the head

00:06:57.405 --> 00:06:59.179
by some bored rent-a-cop.

00:06:59.179 --> 00:07:02.801
If the ninjas took me out, there
would at least be some dignity to that.

00:07:02.801 --> 00:07:04.700
With you, there's nothing.

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:06.652
Absolutely nothing.

00:07:06.652 --> 00:07:08.157
Okay, is this the reactor?

00:07:09.080 --> 00:07:10.572
IS YOUR NAME "REACTOR"?!

00:07:12.782 --> 00:07:14.810
HEY, THIS IS A MISUNDERSTANDING!

00:07:14.810 --> 00:07:15.601
JESUS!

00:07:17.753 --> 00:07:20.032
I'M NOT EVEN SURE I HAVE THE RIGHT ROOM!

00:07:20.699 --> 00:07:21.196
AAAH!

00:07:24.665 --> 00:07:26.093
[gun clicks]

00:07:26.093 --> 00:07:27.217
DAMMIT, I'M OUT!

00:07:27.795 --> 00:07:28.373
HI!

00:07:30.366 --> 00:07:31.290
HOW ARE YOU NOT--

00:07:33.401 --> 00:07:37.737
Good God! I didn't realize the aliens
made this their bathhouse!

00:07:37.737 --> 00:07:39.801
[hivehand firing]
AAAAH!

00:07:39.801 --> 00:07:41.200
WHAT THE FUCK?!

00:07:41.200 --> 00:07:43.279
YOU WEREN'T THERE AND NOW YOU'RE REAL!

00:07:43.279 --> 00:07:45.437
THIS IS INNSBRUCK ALL OVER AGAIN!

00:07:46.355 --> 00:07:49.125
GO! BACK! TO NOTHING!

00:07:49.125 --> 00:07:50.667
THAT'S WHERE YOU BELONG!

00:07:51.567 --> 00:07:53.805
Okay, I'm going to stay in my corner.

00:07:53.805 --> 00:07:58.483
Then, to sneak up on me, you have to
teleport into a wall, so fuck you!

00:08:02.124 --> 00:08:06.244
You know what the difference is between
my hallucinations and other people's?

00:08:06.244 --> 00:08:09.843
My hallucinations shoot back at
me and kill other people.

